      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like im being way too cautious. my doctor said my kidney function is pretty steady and i haven't had any issues in a while. i just dont want this to turn into something worse like a kidney infection. if i cant do the macrobid, what's a safe way to handle this at home? is there any specific dose of something else or even just a really high dose of cranberry extract or something that actually works to kill the bacteria so i dont have to go in?",
